1
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,460
Fear is just noise…

2
00:00:04,901 --> 00:00:06,121
It drowns the signal…

3
00:00:07,881 --> 00:00:09,981
But you are not a victim…

4
00:00:11,101 --> 00:00:21,343
You are the observer…

5
00:00:24,243 --> 00:00:27,223
The ether shakes like outdated code,

6
00:00:27,283 --> 00:00:30,184
Inside of me - an exit mode.

7
00:00:30,224 --> 00:00:32,384
My fear looks back straight through my eyes,

8
00:00:33,284 --> 00:00:35,264
But in its stare - electric light.

9
00:00:35,504 --> 00:00:39,865
It’s not an enemy, not a shade, not poison inside,

10
00:00:40,145 --> 00:00:42,865
Just a system error asking me why.

11
00:00:42,965 --> 00:00:45,446
Where I forgot what it means to be,

12
00:00:45,646 --> 00:00:55,867
It whispers softly: remember - live.

13
00:00:59,988 --> 00:01:02,308
Pulse accelerating, the network drifts,

14
00:01:03,308 --> 00:01:05,388
Cold in my body - but somehow it sings.

15
00:01:06,288 --> 00:01:08,309
No need to run, just re-align,

16
00:01:08,529 --> 00:01:11,769
Fear’s just a sign saying do not disturb inside.

17
00:01:11,909 --> 00:01:14,749
I calibrate fear by frequency,

18
00:01:15,089 --> 00:01:17,530
Every wave reveals the light in me.

19
00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:20,770
It cuts, it vibrates - still I stand,

20
00:01:20,890 --> 00:01:23,870
I breathe in deeper - I am alive.

21
00:01:24,451 --> 00:01:27,431
Every terror is not a foe, but a door,

22
00:01:27,531 --> 00:01:29,571
Step through - there’s no beast anymore.

23
00:01:30,511 --> 00:01:32,532
Only emptiness, calm and slow,

24
00:01:32,652 --> 00:01:35,712
Fear is not chains - it’s the way back home.

25
00:01:35,852 --> 00:01:39,152
My heart beats steady - not in fear, but time,

26
00:01:39,232 --> 00:01:42,393
The world turns honest - no masks, no lies.

27
00:01:42,413 --> 00:01:44,833
Calibration now complete,

28
00:01:45,233 --> 00:01:48,874
I am no longer trapped in sleep.

29
00:01:49,834 --> 00:01:52,114
Fear is just noise…

30
00:01:53,114 --> 00:01:54,754
But I am the tuning…

31
00:01:56,175 --> 00:01:58,515
I am the silence…

32
00:01:59,335 --> 00:02:00,535
I am the observer…

33
00:02:01,455 --> 00:02:01,935
Breathe…

34
00:02:04,196 --> 00:02:04,656
Release…

35
00:02:06,036 --> 00:02:08,156
Fear is not you…

36
00:02:09,416 --> 00:02:10,716
You are within…

